<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>JdbcTemplate 페이징</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif; margin: 40px; background: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; }
        main { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: white; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); }
        th, td { padding: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: left; }
        .paging { margin-top: 20px; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
        .paging a, .paging span { padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; background: white; color: #0f172a; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06); }
        .current { background: #2563eb; color: white; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <h1>예제 (2) Spring MVC + Mustache + JdbcTemplate</h1>
    <p>정렬 기준은 <strong>id DESC</strong>, 조회는 <strong>LIMIT / OFFSET</strong>으로 직접 계산한다.</p>

    <table>
        <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>ID</th>
            <th>제목</th>
            <th>내용</th>
        </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {{#boards}}
            <tr>
                <td>{{id}}</td>
                <td>{{title}}</td>
                <td>{{content}}</td>
            </tr>
        {{/boards}}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="paging">
        {{#paging.hasPrevious}}
            <a href="/jdbc/boards?page={{paging.previousPage}}">이전</a>
        {{/paging.hasPrevious}}

        {{#paging.pageNumbers}}
            <a href="/jdbc/boards?page={{.}}">{{.}}</a>
        {{/paging.pageNumbers}}

        {{#paging.hasNext}}
            <a href="/jdbc/boards?page={{paging.nextPage}}">다음</a>
        {{/paging.hasNext}}
    </div>

    <p><a href="/">홈으로</a></p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
